---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="The Open Home Foundation merch store is temporarily closed while we upgrade how we manage and ship orders. Reopening the first week of October."
    />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap"
    />
    <title>Store temporarily closed — Open Home Foundation</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <img
        class="logo"
        src="https://brands.openhomefoundation.org/api/open-home-foundation/logo/screen/lockup/main/color/light/svg"
        alt="Open Home Foundation"
      />
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="card">
        <div class="content">
          <h1>Store temporarily closed</h1>

          <p class="subheading">Be right back&hellip;</p>

          <p>
            We&rsquo;re upgrading how we manage and ship your orders, which
            means closing our doors for a short while to get everything
            sorted.
          </p>

          <p>The store will reopen in the first week of October.</p>

          <p>
            Already placed an order? It&rsquo;s safe, and will be processed as
            usual. If you have any questions, feel free to reach out
            at <a href="mailto:merchsupport@openhomefoundation.org">merchsupport@openhomefoundation.org</a>.
          </p>

          <p>We look forward to welcoming you back soon!</p>

          <a class="button" href="mailto:merchsupport@openhomefoundation.org"
            >Reach out</a
          >
        </div>

        <img class="illustration" src="/moving.svg" alt="" />
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p class="tagline">Privacy, Choice, Sustainability</p>
      <a href="https://www.openhomefoundation.org">openhomefoundation.org</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ededed;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --heading: #253746;
    --text: #5f6b76;
    --accent: #18bcf2;
    --accent-hover: #0ea3d6;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html,
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100%;
  }

  body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow-x: clip;
    gap: 2rem;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'Instrument Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI',
      Roboto, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: center;
  }

  header .logo {
    width: clamp(9rem, 25vw, 11rem);
    height: auto;
  }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 52rem;
    min-height: 24rem;
    padding: 3rem 3rem 8rem;
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 1rem;
  }

  .content {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 30rem;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .subheading {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .button:hover {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .illustration {
    position: absolute;
    left: 48%;
    bottom: -4rem;
    width: min(86%, 30rem);
    height: auto;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  footer .tagline {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    color: var(--heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  footer a {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .card {
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    }

    .illustration {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -2rem;
      left: 55%;
      width: min(50%, 30rem);
    }
  }
</style>
